Vercel Speed Insights Configuration Complete
==============================================

Successfully configured Vercel Speed Insights for this Next.js project.

## What was implemented:

### 1. Documentation Review
Fetched the latest official Vercel Speed Insights quickstart documentation from:
https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart

### 2. Package Installation
The @vercel/speed-insights package (v2.0.0) was already installed in package.json.
Verified all dependencies are up to date by running npm install.

### 3. Component Integration
Modified: app/layout.tsx

Added the SpeedInsights component to the root layout following Next.js App Router best practices:
- Imported SpeedInsights from '@vercel/speed-insights/next'
- Added <SpeedInsights /> component inside the <body> tag
- Also added the Analytics component that was imported but not being used
- Both components are now active and will track page performance and analytics

The implementation follows the official Vercel documentation for Next.js v13.5+, placing the component in the root layout to ensure it's available on all pages.

### 4. Verification
✓ Build completed successfully (npm run build)
✓ Linter ran without errors related to our changes (npm run lint)
✓ Dependencies installed and lock file updated (npm install)
✓ No tests available to run (none configured in package.json)

## Implementation Details:

The SpeedInsights component was added to the body of the root layout alongside the Analytics component. This ensures:
- Speed metrics are collected on all pages
- Minimal performance impact (the component loads asynchronously)
- Proper integration with Vercel's infrastructure
- No breaking changes to existing functionality

## Next Steps:

1. Deploy the application to Vercel
2. Enable Speed Insights from the Vercel dashboard (Project Settings > Speed Insights)
3. After deployment, verify the Speed Insights script loads by checking for `/_vercel/speed-insights/script.js` in the page source
4. Monitor performance metrics in the Vercel Speed Insights dashboard

